#                                                             ref) -> mcp`
#                                                             body-blocked)
#
#   gen_prism      shards/spectral/gen_prism/mcp_session.    session state
#                    mirror                                    machine + CAS
#                                                             ref advance +
#                                                             read_head
#
#   serve          shards/mcp/serve.mirror  (THIS shard)     composition-
#                                                             shard body
#                                                             wiring
#                                                             primitives into
#                                                             the JSON-RPC
#                                                             loop
